<title>ZIMBABWE: CRICKET-NO PLAY BEFORE LUNCH IN ZIMBABWE-ENGLAND TEST.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-NO PLAY BEFORE LUNCH IN ZIMBABWE-ENGLAND TEST.</headline>
<dateline>HARARE 1996-12-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Heavy overnight rain ruled out play before lunch on the fifth and final day of the second test between Zimbabwe and England on Monday.</p>
<p>Scores:</p>
<p>England 156 and 195-3</p>
<p>Zimbabwe 215</p>
